    "scr_dup": "001",
    "sub_title": "[1] Intermolecular Forces, Phase Changes, Properties of Solutions\n[2] Equilibrium Reactions,  Acid-Base Equilibria, Ionic Equilibria in Aqueous Systems\n[3] Quantum Theory, Atomic Structure, Electron Configuration, Chemical Periodicity",
    "sub_title_en": null,
    "sub_describe": "Chapter 12.    Intermolecular Forces: Liquids, Solids, and Phase Changes\nChapter 13.   The Properties of Solutions\nChapter 17.   Equilibrium:  The Extent of Chemical Reactions\nChapter 18.   Acid-Base Equilibria\nChapter 19.   Ionic Equilibria in Aqueous Systems\nChapter 4.      4.3  Precipitation Reactions\nChapter 7. Quantum Theory and Atomic Structure\nChapter 8.   Electron Configuration and Chemical Periodicity",
    "sub_describe_en": null
  },
  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "普通化學(二)",
    "sub_ename": "GENERAL CHEMISTRY(2)",
    "describe_ch": "本學期普通化學課程闡述原子分子理論，並熟悉化學反應基本原理及觀念。",
    "describe_eh": "General Chemistry（Ⅱ）describes further the theories of atoms and molecules. To provide students with core principles of reactions in the living world.",
